# Byte-exact checkout: this project is Windows-only and several files are BOM/CRLF sensitive
# (PowerShell 5.1 parses a BOM-less .ps1 with the ANSI code page). Never let git rewrite line
# endings -- what is committed is what runs.
* -text

*.ps1   -text
*.cmd   -text

*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.xlsx  binary
*.dxf   -text
*.dwg   binary
*.exe   binary
